      "sourceText": "虽然我的子文件和主文件在逻辑上是有包含关系的，但是其实，他们都是单独的urdf文件。主文件中，robot标签的name属性必须写，子文件可以不写，如果写，那么子文件name的值与主文件的必须相同！",
      "translatedText": "Although my sub\\-file and main file are logically in an inclusion relationship, in reality, they are both separate URDF files\\. In the main file, the name attribute of the robot tag must be written; the sub\\-file may omit it\\. If it is written, the value of the sub\\-file's name must be the same as that of the main file\\!",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 181,
        "outputTokens": 79,
        "costUsd": 0.00015
      }
