      "sourceText": "结构化绑定让你可以**一行语句把复合类型（pair、tuple、结构体）分解成独立的变量**，代码清晰很多。",
      "translatedText": "Structured bindings let you**destructure a composite type (pair, tuple, struct) into separate variables in a single statement**—much clearer code\\.",
