    "3c5a47c64241e61d2af33a3ae31554428416bd7c91e8750ce64fe48909a65afc": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "2074fe9e928b10b1c1bba7b1fb0a1323b74b7d98ecc91f4313c0b1bca533b20a",
      "contextFingerprint": "6b9443adf6a83000b136ee1a6e96d839cf07bba2ab49c84e935c5c20b4375e88",
      "sourceText": "> 问题1：在设计关节的位置时，需要按照一定的规则计算，规则是固定的，但是在 URDF 中依赖于人工计算，存在不便，容易计算失误，且当某些参数发生改变时，还需要重新计算。\n> \n> 问题2：URDF中的部分内容是高度重复的，比如车轮的设计实现，不同轮子只是部分参数不同，形状、颜色、翻转量都是一致的，在实际应用中，构建复杂的机器人模型时，更是易于出现高度重复的设计，按照一般的编程思想涉及到重复代码应该考虑封装、复用，但是在之前的URDF文件中并没有相关操作。\n> \n> ......",
      "translatedText": "> Problem 1: When designing the positions of joints, calculations must be performed according to certain rules\\. The rules are fixed, but in URDF this relies on manual calculation, which is inconvenient and prone to calculation errors\\. Moreover, when some parameters change, recalculation is required\\.\n> \n> Problem 2: Some content in URDF is highly repetitive, such as the design and implementation of wheels\\. Different wheels differ only in some parameters, while their shape, color, and flip amount are identical\\. In practical applications, when building complex robot models, highly repetitive designs are even more likely to occur\\. According to general programming principles, repeated code should be considered for encapsulation and reuse, but in previous URDF files there were no related operations for this\\.\n> \n> \\.\\.\\.\\.\\.\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 250,
        "outputTokens": 158,
        "costUsd": 0.000265
      }
    },
